# SCG CLI — Distribution Task List

## GitHub Action Wrapper

- [ ] Create separate `bds421/scg-action` repository
- [ ] `action.yml` — composite action with check + scope modes
- [ ] Pre-built binary download in action (curl from release)
- [ ] Input parameters: mode, step-name, lockfile, sanitize, no-verify, json
- [ ] Outputs: status, drift-count, violation-count
- [ ] GitHub Marketplace listing
- [ ] Example workflows in README
- [ ] Version tagging (v1, v1.0.0 pattern matching GitHub convention)

## Release Binaries (Goreleaser)

- [ ] `.goreleaser.yml` configuration
- [ ] Cross-compile targets: linux-amd64, linux-arm64, darwin-amd64, darwin-arm64
- [ ] Checksums file (SHA256)
- [ ] Binary signing (cosign or GPG)
- [ ] GitLab CI release pipeline (tag → build → upload)
- [ ] GitHub mirror release (if open-sourcing)
- [ ] Docker image: `ghcr.io/bds421/scg:latest`
- [ ] Homebrew tap formula

## Install Script (scg.bds421.com/install.sh)

- [ ] Detect OS (linux/darwin) and architecture (amd64/arm64)
- [ ] Download correct binary from release
- [ ] Verify checksum
- [ ] Install to /usr/local/bin (or $HOME/.local/bin if no root)
- [ ] Print version after install
- [ ] Host at scg.bds421.com via nginx/CDN
- [ ] HTTPS required (reject HTTP)
